@startuml 06-level-runtime
!pragma layout smetana
title Runtime livello - Facade

left to right direction
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members
hide circle

class "map/levels.yaml" as LevelsYaml <<asset>>
class "level.tmx" as LevelTmx <<asset>>
class SceneController <<Facade>>
class LevelCatalog <<Catalog>>
class TmxLevelLoader <<Loader>>
class LevelRuntime
class LevelScreen <<Boundary>>
class "Physics\nEnemy\nCheckpoint\nNPC\nCollectible" as RuntimeServices <<Services>>

LevelsYaml --> LevelCatalog
LevelTmx --> TmxLevelLoader
SceneController --> LevelCatalog
SceneController --> TmxLevelLoader
SceneController --> LevelRuntime
SceneController --> LevelScreen
LevelScreen --> LevelRuntime
LevelScreen --> RuntimeServices

note bottom of SceneController
Minimo: SceneController carica il livello e apre LevelScreen.
end note
@enduml
